Third-party components

This product bundles a fork of the OpenAI Codex CLI, located at
backend/src/integrations/cli_wrappers/codex (a git submodule of
https://github.com/vicoa-ai/codex) and used only for the backend's
PyInstaller binary build. It is licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0; see that component's own LICENSE (and NOTICE, if present)
for the full text.

The Pi / Oh My Pi integration at backend/src/integrations/headless/pi_family
follows the design and code shape of the `pi` and `omp` agent providers in
paseo (https://github.com/badlogic/paseo), Copyright (c) 2025-present
Mohamed Boudra, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. No paseo
source is bundled; the Python implementation is Vicoa's own, written against
the agents' published RPC protocol and the wire traces archived under
backend/src/integrations/headless/tests/fixtures/omp/.
